I fixed the arithmetic bug in `src/calc.rs`. The original code had:

```rust
pub fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {
    a - b
}
```

This was subtracting `b` from `a`, but the function is named `add()` and should return the sum. I changed it to:

```rust
pub fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {
    a + b
}
```

The change was replacing `-` with `+` in the return statement.

